span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">var95</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">actual</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{ </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">var95</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">actual</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowSize; t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> returns.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> window</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> returns.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowSize, t);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">historicalVaR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeVaR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(window, confidence);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      date: t,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      var95: historicalVaR,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      actual: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">returns[t],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CVaR（Conditional VaR，条件在险价值）是 VaR 的补充指标，它衡量的是当损失超过 VaR 阈值时的平均损失大小。CVaR 比 VaR 更能反映尾部风险的严重程度，且具有次可加性（即组合的 CVaR 不超过各部分 CVaR 之和），这使得它成为投资组合优化中的首选风险度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高频数据与已实现波动率\">高频数据与已实现波动率</h2><p>随着交易所数据粒度从日频提升到毫秒级，高频金融数据为波动率估计提供了全新的视角。已实现波动率（Realized Volatility）利用日内高频收益率的平方和来直接估计日度波动率，相比 GARCH 模型从日度数据间接推断波动率更为精确。</p>\n<p>已实现波动率的计算公式为 RV = Σᵢ rᵢ²，其中 rᵢ 是日内第 i 个采样间隔的对数收益率。HAR-RV（Heterogeneous Autoregressive Realized Volatility）模型进一步将已实现波动率分解为日、周、月三个时间尺度的移动平均，用简单的线性模型捕获波动率的长记忆性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[高频数据] --&gt; B[已实现波动率 RV]&#10;    B --&gt; C[HAR-RV 模型]&#10;    C --&gt; D[日频 RV]&#10;    C --&gt; E[周频 RV 均值]&#10;    C --&gt; F[月频 RV 均值]&#10;    D --&gt; G[预测未来波动率]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[高频数据] --&gt; B[已实现波动率 RV]\n    B --&gt; C[HAR-RV 模型]\n    C --&gt; D[日频 RV]\n    C --&gt; E[周频 RV 均值]\n    C --&gt; F[月频 RV 均值]\n    D --&gt; G[预测未来波动率]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>高频数据的一个核心挑战是市场微观结构噪声：买卖价差、离散报价和异步交易会使高频收益率偏离真实价格变动。常用的去噪方法包括稀疏采样（每 5 分钟采样一次而非逐笔）和已实现核估计（Realized Kernel）等统计方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>金融时间序列具有尖峰厚尾、波动率聚集、杠杆效应和长记忆性等独特统计特性</li>\n<li>GARCH 族模型是波动率建模的基石，EGARCH 和 GJR-GARCH 捕获非对称的杠杆效应</li>\n<li>VaR 和 CVaR 是金融风险度量的核心指标，CVaR 比 VaR 更能反映尾部风险</li>\n<li>高频数据和已实现波动率为波动率估计提供了更精确的直接度量</li>\n<li>HAR-RV 模型用简单的多尺度线性结构有效捕获波动率的长记忆性</li>\n<li>金融预测模型的有效性最终由经济价值（而非统计指标）来衡量</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"金融时间序列","id":"金融时间序列"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GARCH 族波动率模型","id":"garch-族波动率模型"},{"level":2,"text":"风险价值与尾部建模","id":"风险价值与尾部建模"},{"level":2,"text":"高频数据与已实现波动率","id":"高频数据与已实现波动率"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时序异常检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/anomaly-detection-ts"},"next":{"title":"需求预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-applications/demand-forecasting"}}